# Reference Preserved v39

Main right bank is the v37 deterministic projection, preserved by compositing its right half at 1:1 pixel scale. Two separately generated supplementary banks occupy left half. Main bank is not regenerated. Retains v37 source-edge truncation and radial projection limitations. Review concept, not material channel packing or final alpha. No level replacement.

Supplementary banks generated with built-in image tool. Upper-left orientation revised in second pass. Their tangential alignment remains a review item. Additional_Banks.png retains generator original.

## Supplement prompt

Generate ONLY TWO supplementary cloud banks for a polar UV atlas. Square black canvas. Entire RIGHT HALF must be EMPTY PURE BLACK because an existing original cloud bank will be composited there unchanged. Keep center black. Two separated banks on LEFT outer perimeter only, one upper-left at 10 o'clock, another lower-left at 7 o'clock. Large black gap between banks. No full ring.
Use attached planar painting as style and proportion reference: low long flat cloud layers connected to a few unequal tall broad rises, sparse thin short tangential tails, large quiet flat overlapping grayscale shadow planes. Not thin identical crescents, not a row of scalloped balls. Upper-left bank medium long and shallow; lower-left bank shorter with one broad asymmetric rise. Dense flat gray underside, pale filled light planes on inward crowns. Minimal tiny bumps. No honeycomb, little repetitive paint dabs, no outlines. Preserve the feeling of a wide low horizontal cloud strip bent locally along circumference.
At upper-left CROWNS face DOWN-RIGHT toward image center, BASE faces UP-LEFT. At lower-left CROWNS face UP-RIGHT toward center, BASE faces DOWN-LEFT. Long axes and tails run tangentially around circumference; never horizontal across canvas or radial into center. Outer radius about 43 percent of canvas width, maximum bank thickness about 12 percent of width. Black margins. Whole right half strictly black. Output grayscale on opaque black, no labels, no arrows or other objects.
